# 仓库内容统一存 LF；检出也强制 LF。
# Windows 上 Git 默认 core.autocrlf=true 会把检出文件变成 CRLF，而 generate-*.mjs
# 一类脚本写回的是 LF，于是每次构建都把工作树标记成"已修改"（本分支曾据此误判依赖损坏）。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.onnx binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary

# Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
